# This repo
# Third-party material never goes in the repository (hark_web AGENTS.md):
# the public firmware dumps are cloned into third_party/, and anything derived
# from Kodak's firmware - built update packages, full images, disassembly,
# extracted frames and icons - stays on disk.
third_party/
work/
build/
build_v1/
source/
*.bin
*.elf
*.o
*.map
# Generated by tools/fx_tables.py at build time.
fx_text/fx_tables.h
# PDFs stay out of the repository (hark_web, planning/decisions.md).
*.pdf
